  "text": "Every message gives couples the opportunity to ask questions, just as they would with a member of your team. The difference is they don't need to wait for office hours. Questions are answered instantly, day or night, without the enquiry being left waiting. Whether they're asking about guest numbers, accommodation, availability, pricing, or whether the family dog can be part of the day. The conversation keeps moving. And when a couple is ready to take the next step, VenueBot doesn't just suggest a tour. It books one. Convert integrates directly with Google Calendar, Outlook, HubSpot, and your existing wedding operational systems. So the moment a couple chooses a time, the tour is in your diary. The couple gets a confirmation. Your team gets a notification. No back and forth. No double bookings. No couples slipping through because nobody was free to take the call.",
